WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
This is just a little bit of food, as for showing off like this

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
She is too naive if she wants to take advantage of me

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Yuqing, how about you invite her to your house for dinner and ask her to bring the ingredients?

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
This way you can eat Olong and steak without losing face

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
She will definitely be happy for our family to have dinner

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Yes, give her a chance to have dinner with you

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
She will definitely agree immediately with excitement

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,540
Then give her a chance

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,540
Invite me to dinner?

10
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,540
She wanted me to bring supplies there

11
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,730
Do you want to treat me to dinner?

12
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:29,730
OK, thank you then

13
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,730
Zhang Yi simply doesn’t know what’s good or bad

14
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:36,390
I lifted her up and she suddenly became so ignorant.

15
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,390
Didn’t I chase you every day before?

16
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:40,390
From now on, I will never talk to her again

17
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:43,390
Even if she comes to beg me then, I will ignore her.

18
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:45,390
Even if you don’t look at your own virtues

19
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:47,390
I want to chase you but I'm still so stingy

20
00:00:47,390 --> 00:00:49,390
This kind of man deserves to be single for the rest of his life
